OL,3,GNEWSAMajor dance festival Terminal V to
OL,4,Abe held on banks of River Clyde
OL,5,
OL,6,FElectronic music festival Terminal V
OL,7,Fwill be held on the banks of the River
OL,8,FClyde next year, as the event comes to
OL,9,FGlasgow for the first time.
OL,11,FOrganisers EE Live announced earlier
OL,12,Fthis year it was moving from Edinburgh
OL,13,Fto Glasgow for the festival's 10th
OL,14,Fanniversary in 2027, but did not reveal
OL,15,Fdetails of where in the city it would
OL,16,Fbe held.
OL,18,FNow Clydeside Live - a new dedicated
OL,19,Fopen-air event space on the north bank
OL,20,Fof the river - has been confirmed as
OL,21,Fthe location.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
