OL,3,GNEWSAMajor dance festival Terminal V to
OL,4,Abe held on banks of River Clyde
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe festival will run from Friday 4 to
OL,7,FSunday 6 June and marks the dance
OL,8,Fevent's first fully outdoor Scottish
OL,9,Ffestival.
